        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/reckless/{size}/2467_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-10-21T17:21:31.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Gloomweaver in The Tomb of Anubis is one of my favorites.&nbsp; My group has never had much of a challenge with ol' GW, but that combination with zombies and mummies and ancient artifacts all surrounding a dark&nbsp;god&nbsp;make it feel like a pen-and-paper dungeon crawl with super heroes!&nbsp; We always have fun with that set-up.&nbsp; Always.</p>",
