        "created_at": "2012-10-21T20:21:28.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I tend to find the Tomb of Anubis a pretty good environment anyway, since a lot of the Trial cards always seem to hit villain targets :D. About the only really annoying card in that deck is the Scarab Swarm - 5hp, damage taken reduced by one, heroes can't draw cards.</p>",
